 ## Subtopics
 
 ### MaskGaussian Pipeline
-The broader framework where Masked-Rasterization is used. It formulates pruning based on existence probability and uses the rasterization technique to dynamically assess Gaussian importance. [MaskGaussian](https://doi.org/10.1109/cvpr52734.2025.00072)
